Package: robot-setup
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, pkexec | policykit-1, sudo
Maintainer: Robot Setup maintainers <https://github.com/darshanadinushal/robot-setup/issues>
Homepage: https://github.com/darshanadinushal/robot-setup
Description: one-time setup wizard for the Luna robot on Raspberry Pi
 Robot Setup installs and configures Luna (robot face, offline voice, optional
 online AI and automatic startup) on Raspberry Pi OS. It runs once, can be
 reopened to repair or add features, and is not needed while Luna runs.
 Installing this package changes nothing else; open Robot Setup to start.
